msgstr "跟随系统，或固定为浅色、深色"

msgid "Group code"
msgstr "组码"

msgid "Group codes identify groups. They are not passwords and do not pair or authorize devices."
msgstr "组码只用来标识组，不是密码，也不能代替配对授权。"

msgid "Group codes identify groups. They are not passwords and do not pair or authorize devices. Both devices must select the same group and include each other before they sync; nothing is relayed through other devices."
msgstr "组码只用来标识组，不是密码，也不能代替配对授权。两端选中同一个组并互相勾选为成员后才会同步，内容不经其他设备中继。"

msgid "Group name"
msgstr "组名称"

msgid "Image clipboard"
msgstr "图片剪贴板"

msgid "Join group"
msgstr "加入组"

msgid "Lava Connect keeps syncing from the system tray. Use Quit in the tray menu or Ctrl+Q to stop it."
msgstr "Lava Connect 会在系统托盘中继续同步。要停止，请使用托盘菜单中的“退出”或按 Ctrl+Q。"

msgid "License"
msgstr "许可证"

msgid "Light"
msgstr "浅色"

msgid "Local network only · TLS 1.3 over QUIC · no account, no cloud"
msgstr "仅局域网 · TLS 1.3 / QUIC · 无账户、无云端"

msgid "Looking for devices on the local network…"
msgstr "正在发现同一局域网中的设备…"

