msgstr "只有两端显示相同的代码和这个设备 ID 时才确认。"

msgid "Only paired devices can be members. Pair a device on the Devices page to add it here."
msgstr "只有已配对的设备才能成为成员。在“设备”页配对后即可在这里添加。"

msgid "Pair"
msgstr "配对"

msgid "Pair this device to sync clipboards with it."
msgstr "配对后才能与这台设备同步剪贴板。"

msgid "Pairing"
msgstr "配对中"

msgid "Pairing code"
msgstr "配对代码"

